-atlas/texas/coleman-county"],["ARC or PLC in Coleman County","/arc-plc/texas/coleman-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Coleman County record runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025, on the middle of the grids, August to September came in at 38% of normal and September to October at 40%. Grid 13624 had its driest year in 1954, at 44% of normal.</p>"}
